  <header class="hero">
    <div class="eyebrow">Reusable Components · UX Assets</div>
    <h1>Mood — an emotional-design asset kit</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      A series of <b>non-functional</b> illustrations and animated assets. They render no data and gate no flow —
      their only job is to make the moments <i>around</i> the work feel human: less anxious, more delightful, worth coming back to.
      Each asset is mapped to one emotional moment in a product journey, with the <b>UX payoff</b> it earns.
    </p>
    <div class="principles">
      <div class="principle"><div class="pt">Visceral</div><div class="pd">First-glance warmth — soft shapes, friendly faces, gentle motion.</div></div>
      <div class="principle"><div class="pt">Behavioral</div><div class="pd">Motion reassures: progress, success, and patience made visible.</div></div>
      <div class="principle"><div class="pt">Reflective</div><div class="pd">Personality the user remembers and re-tells to others.</div></div>
    </div>
