        <div class="benefit"><span class="ico">↑</span><span>Positive reinforcement closes the loop and nudges the next action.</span></div>
        <div class="tags"><span class="tag">submit</span><span class="tag">checkout</span><span class="tag">streaks</span></div>
      </div>
    </article>

