    <article class="card" data-cat="recovery" style="--c:var(--accent)">
      <div class="stage">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 120 120" role="img" aria-label="Gentle unplugged cable, calm error">
          <g class="a-sway">
            <path d="M40 40 q-12 14 0 30" stroke="#e9b08a" stroke-width="7" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <rect x="34" y="64" width="14" height="16" rx="4" fill="#e07b39"/>
            <path d="M80 40 q12 14 0 30" stroke="#e9b08a" stroke-width="7" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <rect x="72" y="64" width="14" height="16" rx="4" fill="#e07b39"/>
            <circle cx="79" cy="60" r="1.6" fill="#1c2026"/>
            <circle cx="83" cy="62" r="1.6" fill="#1c2026"/>
            <path d="M77 67 Q79 65 81 67" stroke="#1c2026" stroke-width="1.4" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </g>
          <path d="M58 54 l4 0 m-2 -2 l0 4" stroke="#f5a623" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" class="a-pulse"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="body">
        <div class="kind">Error · Reassurance</div>
        <div class="name">A loose connection</div>
        <p class="goal">An unplugged-cable mascot frames failure as fixable and small — never the user's fault.</p>
        <div class="benefit"><span class="ico">↑</span><span>Defuses frustration and lowers rage-quits; pairs with a clear retry.</span></div>
        <div class="tags"><span class="tag">network</span><span class="tag">500</span><span class="tag">offline</span></div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 4. LOADING / PATIENCE -->
    <article class="card" data-cat="waiting" style="--c:var(--sky)">
      <div class="stage">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 120 120" role="img" aria-label="Playful orbiting loader">
          <circle cx="60" cy="60" r="26" fill="none" stroke="#e2e5ea" stroke-width="6"/>
          <g class="a-orbit">
            <circle cx="60" cy="34" r="7" fill="#6aa9e9"/>
          </g>
          <g class="a-orbit" style="animation-duration:2.4s">
            <circle cx="60" cy="86" r="5" fill="#f5a623"/>
          </g>
          <circle cx="60" cy="60" r="9" fill="#fff" stroke="#cdd6e2" stroke-width="2" class="a-pulse"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="body">
        <div class="kind">Loading · Patience</div>
        <div class="name">Hang tight</div>
        <p class="goal">Two cheerful dots orbiting a calm core make a wait feel shorter and intentional.</p>
        <div class="benefit"><span class="ico">↑</span><span>Continuous motion lowers perceived wait time and signals "still working".</span></div>

